        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 220404, 4 Inch Sandcast Bronze Recessed Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sandcast Bronze 4 Inch Flush Pull features a low profile that makes it a good choice for use on sliding pocket doors. It is mortised into the face of the door for a clean look once installed. The 4 Inch Sandcast Bronze Recessed Pull is available in flat black, medium bronze, and tumble white bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-220404-specifications.gif?v=1704354567 \"width=\"443\" height=\"325\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 220404 Flush Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-6-inch-flush-pull-emtek-220406\"><b>6\" Flush Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-8-inch-flush-pull-emtek-220408\"><b>8\" Flush Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-10-inch-flush-pull-emtek-220410\"><b>10\" Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 4 Inch Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Height: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-220404-specifications.pdf?v=1704262374\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 220404 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
